{"version":1,"content":"<p>吳岱融接受新城知訊台節目《Ben 同 Benson「chur」住傾》主持人李有毅及李國煒訪問，這位曾演活「花無缺」、「高天鷲」及《巨塔之後》文金榮經典角色的資深藝人，暢談入行40多年起伏、與太太鍾淑慧緣分，更自揭養生之道秘訣，當年靠加拿大的清新空氣成功戒煙。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.791311+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T12:58:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T17:10:03.621882+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.351660+00:00","content_hash":"70735d492c731cbc9c1843c899b69d7c4136e9d5505e9be4926e50e9cf1e7c69","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}